               <p xml:id="idm356">The text is the final part of Christian Richardt's cycle of poems "Et Aar" (A Year) inspired by the German-Danish war in 1864. It was published in December that year, so Hartmann must have received the poems in advance. After being performed at the song festival in Aarhus in 1890 with approximately 900 participating singers from Copenhagen and Jutland, it became very popular in Jutland.</p>
